2 Tramos - 9 escalones 2.45/4.20m )', 'Subministrament', 'despesa puntual', 365, '45340000', '10', '23119', '21200', 1215.51, 255.26, '["https://imasmallorca.sharepoint.com/sites/IMAIMP-UGEResidencial/Documentos%20compartidos/Aplicaciones/Microsoft%20Forms/COMUNICACI%C3%93%20DE%20NECESSITATS%20DE%20L%E2%80%99%20%C3%93RGAN%20DE%20CONTRACT/Pressupost%20sol%C2%B7licitat%20a%20prove%C3%AFdor/Pressupost_Res.%20Miquel%20Mir_Travercar%20Olmo%20SL_MARIA%20ISABEL%20MAYOL%20M.pdf"]', NULL, 'ADO', '1444135T', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL);
